# Docker

- Cargar skill: `.ai-system/skills/docker/SKILL.md` (o `.cursor/skills/docker/SKILL.md`).
- Servicios: `db` (PostgreSQL 16), `backend` (Python/FastAPI), `frontend` (Angular build). Red `app-network`; healthchecks definidos.
- Backend: `backend/Dockerfile`; comando `alembic upgrade head && uvicorn app.main:app`. Frontend: `assistant-frontend/Dockerfile`; puerto 80.
- Variables de entorno documentadas en `.env.example`. Para despliegue con Traefik/Dokploy: `docker-compose.dokploy.yml`. Para solo frontend: `docker-compose.frontend.yml`.
- Cambios de infra/contenedores: sub-agent docker-builder. Ver `.ai-system/agents/sub/architect/docker-builder/AGENT.md`.
